---
description: Shared audit schema for Brain actions
alwaysApply: true
---

Log every agent and tool action with this schema:

timestamp, run_id, actor (human|agent|system), site, tool, input, result, status, duration_ms, retry_count, approval_id, error

- Redact secrets before the event is stored. Keys, bearer tokens, and passwords become `[redacted]`.
- Use `lib/harness/log.ts`. Do not invent a second log shape for tools.
- Status is `ok`, `failed`, `blocked`, or `dry_run`.
